WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.010
<b> It's Starting</b>

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:03.690
Good morning.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:06.600
Huh? I guess no one's here yet.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:09.070
<b>Even though
 it's starting...</b>

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.470
Geijutsuka Art Design Class

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.310
<b>Pow!</b>

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:45.780
It all began with this sound.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:49.730
Noda-chan was collapsed on her desk.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:56.850
Behind her, a brooding Tomokane-san.

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.310
<i>See, I was looking at 
the part in her hair</i>

00:02:01.310 --> 00:02:03.370
<i>and I couldn't help myself.</i>

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:06.350
<i>You chopped her?</i>

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:12.810
<b> The Haunted Art Room</b>

00:02:15.050 --> 00:02:15.810
Here,

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.280
I'm returning this.

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:20.000
Are you sure? I only just 
lent it to you last week.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.480
It wasn't interesting?

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:23.210
That's not it.

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:28.220
I left it for a second and 
my brother started playing...

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:30.800
He used my save data,
and beat the final boss.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:32.280
Your brother's amazing!

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:33.200
Everything is max'd!

00:02:34.010 --> 00:02:36.310
He's a second year here, right?

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:38.600
Just lend me a different game.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:40.610
 Nurse's Office

00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:44.990
Oh, are you feeling better now?

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:47.570
Yes, thank you very much.

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:50.520
Say, do you have a moment?

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:52.080
Yes?

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.220
Whoa, what's this?

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:00.930
It's pitch black in here.

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:04.040
Are you sure... this is the right place?

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:07.820
Sure. We always hold club 
activities in this art room.

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:08.830
What's this?

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:10.800
Oh, Zumi's here.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:12.180
Call me Uozumi.

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.580
Is the club not meeting today?

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.610
No, we should be.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:19.480
See? The sign's taped up like always.

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:21.480
Fine Arts Club In Session

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:28.120
Fine Arts Club In Session

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:28.120
<b>Only Today</b>

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:28.120
<b>Punishment for those 
who don't attend, Yo</b>

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:28.120
<b>Notice: Today's Club Meeting 
Attendance Mandatory,</b>

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:28.120
<b>A special fun 
today only!</b>

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:26.110
We can be sure that she's 
hatched some kind of scheme.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:32.280
This is the first time I've seen 
the art room completely pitch black.

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.660
There's someone over there!

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.730
Is she... a club member?

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:43.290
I can't see her face, but 
that's probably the president.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:49.060
 Napping Box

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:47.710
There's only one person I 
know who wears a box to sleep.

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:56.250
The president as usual.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:57.990
With such a cute sleeping face.

00:03:57.990 --> 00:03:59.450
W-w-wait a minute.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:02.450
Can't you guys freak 
out a little more?

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:03.980
It's no fun!

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:06.720
I saw right through it
as soon as I walked in.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:11.310
Man, and I spent all week 
putting this together.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.450
Oh, I see.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:14.230
Club time, club time.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.620
I can't get it off.

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:17.620
So, is this how it is every week?

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:19.560
Yep. Pretty much.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.180
Hi~!

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:27.310
Gaaaaah!

00:04:27.520 --> 00:04:29.980
W-what was that voice?!

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:32.800
Almost like someone had water dumped down their back.

00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:34.450
Don't mind them.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.990
They're just club activities.

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:38.990
Fine Arts Club In Session

00:04:38.990 --> 00:04:41.650
My, that reaction was way
 better than I expected.

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:42.960
Makes it all worth it.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.270
There's no way I would've 
thought you'd go this far!

00:04:45.270 --> 00:04:46.890
How much free time do you have?!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:50.640
All this stuff was made by old students and left for us.

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.480
Really? All of this?

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:56.270
Aa-san brought it out of the back room last week.

00:04:56.270 --> 00:05:01.630
They made all this stuff while 
working on an exhibition.

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:03.450
So nostalgic!

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:05.790
Or rather, while working on the exhibition

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:07.750
they got obsessed with 
making these instead.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.970
And we were the victims...

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:15.370
The club's initiation 
left some traumatic scars.

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:17.700
I think I understand.

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:20.300
This is a tradition for the club, right?

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:23.400
And they even made these
props with such care.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:23.450
Lord have mercy on...

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:26.460
When we put our minds to it,

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:29.700
we make props that 
outdo the drama club.

00:05:31.050 --> 00:05:32.980
Oh! This is my favorite.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.660
Page-a-day Mona Lisa!

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:35.780
Page-a-day?

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:37.590
When it's hanging 
on the wall like this,

00:05:37.590 --> 00:05:39.320
it looks like a normal painting, but...

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:41.430
as you pull out each page,

00:05:41.430 --> 00:05:44.210
the Mona Lisa starts to 
move closer and closer

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:47.300
focusing her eyes hungrily on you!

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:48.280
This is a sc-

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:51.560
Doesn't this club make anything normal?!

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:53.980
Seriously, what are they thinking?

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:57.620
Are you okay? 
You look a little pale.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:01.540
I'm fine. Just a little tired.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:04.950
Are you one of Homura-kun's friends?

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:06.730
You're wearing a Junior's tie.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:08.750
Oh, no. I just ran into him

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.200
in front of the art room.

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:13.730
I'm a Junior at GA.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:15.700
I heard there were club activities here,

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:16.640
so I came to investigate...

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.590
Investigate?!

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:31.850
<b>Squeeeeze</b>

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:31.850
<b>rumble rumble</b>

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:31.850
You won't escape!        Join Join Join...

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.390
How good of you to come!

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:20.570
Won't you have a seat?

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:23.100
E-Excuse me,

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:26.470
but do you think you could 
take off your costume make up?

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:31.870
Sorry. That's our 
usual president for you.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:37.140
Staff Room

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.400
Professor Sasamoto,

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:40.540
I believe that the student

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.280
we were talking about will 
be attending today.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:44.790
Oh, I'll go check it out later.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:46.280
Student?

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.380
Yes.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:50.550
He tends to get sick regularly 
and is often in my office.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:54.430
He's hardly attended any
classes since his first year.

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:56.560
Staying engaged in classes

00:06:56.560 --> 00:06:58.370
with his other classmates 
would be difficult, right?

00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:01.870
I consulted with Professor 
Sasamoto who said that

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:03.950
it would probably help if he 
participated in some club activities.

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:06.960
If everything goes well

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.040
then there shouldn't be 
anything to worry about.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:14.190
If not, then the worst that'll 
happen is he'll drop out.

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:16.810
Why would anything that extreme happen?!

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:18.190
Oh, error.

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:22.010
So that's why you're visiting.

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:22.870
Yup.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:25.410
S-so our imitation test of courage may have

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:28.140
ended up shaving a few 
years off your life?!

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.360
Oh, no. It's all right.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:35.270
I'm actually a fan of sculpture 
and I find this stuff interesting.

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:38.750
Oh. That's the one I made two years ago.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:41.330
Wow. This is pretty good.

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:44.140
In particular, this 
caved in part here

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:46.210
is very realistic and raw-feeling.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.680
<b>Lord have mercy on...</b>

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.680
<b> Thwack!</b>

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:47.680
 Hi-yah!

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:50.080
That was the result of

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.100
our current female 
member's roundhouse kick.

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:56.190
U-um...

00:07:56.190 --> 00:07:58.790
Oh, this is the one I made.

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:59.250
Would it be okay if I borrowed

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.170
Wolf?

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:01.040
some of these broken ones?

00:08:01.930 --> 00:08:04.410
I was inspired looking 
at all of these,

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:07.850
and I kinda want to try 
making some myself.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.690
Oh, of course it's okay!

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:13.200
Use any of the tools in this box!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:14.760
Thank you so much.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:17.940
Even though I'm the one 
who intruded on you guys...

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:19.550
It's fine!

00:08:19.550 --> 00:08:22.510
One must always cultivate 
a creative soul.

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:30.270
<b>You'll never escape 
You'll never escape</b>

00:08:22.630 --> 00:08:30.270
<b> New Member
 New Member 
New Member</b>

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:26.500
I wonder when I developed super powers.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:29.920
I can see what she's thinking.

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:33.490
All these materials kinda make me

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.930
want to go scare someone.

00:08:35.930 --> 00:08:38.450
Right? You think so too, right?

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.550
At least I have confidence that

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:42.500
I can scare better than 
the president just now.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:45.130
Oh. Well you sure do talk big.

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:48.580
I challenge you to make me jump.

00:08:48.580 --> 00:08:50.250
I'll be waiting outside.

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:52.750
President, you already know 
about all of the props!

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:54.580
I'm at a disadvantage here.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.840
If we can erase the 
president's memory,

00:08:56.200 --> 00:09:04.860
<b>Whoosh</b>

00:08:57.840 --> 00:08:58.960
we shouldn't have a problem.

00:08:58.960 --> 00:09:00.260
Right!

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:01.110
What's this?

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:04.300
Has the test of courage already begun?

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:06.490
Oh.

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:09.790
I better go to the art 
room before I forget.

00:09:09.790 --> 00:09:12.160
Hm? Did you forget something?

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.330
During class today,

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.800
I noticed one of the easels 
had a broken fastener.

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:18.600
I thought I should get it 
fixed before I forget.

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:21.030
Oh, well would you mind checking

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:22.740
on Art Room 2 while you're there?

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:26.210
You're the advisor, aren't you?

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.000
You just said you would go yourself.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:29.320
It's fine, it's fine.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:31.530
If you could just check 
on how things are going...

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:32.460
Oh...

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:34.570
...and if something is 
wildly out of control

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:36.260
just go ahead and put 
it back in order.

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:38.390
What do you mean by "something"?!

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:45.780
Something like this...?

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:48.300
Whaaa~ Awesome!

00:09:48.780 --> 00:09:51.690
I've added a simple 
gimmick here as well.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.830
Wicked! It opened its mouth! Creepy!

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.020
You got a great reaction as well.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:57.130
<b>Bop</b>

00:09:57.440 --> 00:09:59.310
This is made of foam.

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.050
Looking at this, I realize

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:03.690
that you really are an art 
student, aren't you?

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:06.600
Oh no, I've really barely started.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:09.190
But, when you say it that way...

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:12.060
I feel like I could

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:14.790
pass as one or at least 
try to apply myself...

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:16.180
Has he awakened?!

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.600
Art students have a

00:10:17.600 --> 00:10:19.030
high probability of being 
weirdos, don't they?

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:21.570
I'm an art student as well.

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:24.060
If you're looking for a test subject,

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:26.340
why don't we check out 
a classroom at random?

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.970
There are probably 
students still around.

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:31.750
Ooh! I hope they're gullible!

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:37.630
Oh, Mizubuchi-san.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:39.280
Professor Same-chan.

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:41.390
Oh, the Art Room is a little...

00:10:41.390 --> 00:10:42.780
Professor Sasamoto told me to check on

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:45.400
how things were going 
in the Fine Arts Club.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:47.050
You're doing it today right?

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:48.420
Your sign is up.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:53.360
Oh, go ahead.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:55.530
We have some very exciting 
activities happening right now.

00:10:55.530 --> 00:10:58.110
We're making use of 
blackout curtains today

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:00.290
so please be careful.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.670
You're right. It's completely black.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:07.180
When you think about it,

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:10.900
scaring third years seems bad somehow...

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:12.180
Someone's here!

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:14.250
Huh? It's Professor Same-chan.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:16.710
What?! That hot teacher?

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:18.090
What a chance!

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:19.980
Why's he getting so into it?

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:22.910
T-They might get mad at us...

00:11:22.910 --> 00:11:24.060
Having Professor Same-chan get mad at me

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:26.190
is a long cherished dream!

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:29.100
As long as she remembers who I am!

00:11:29.100 --> 00:11:30.030
Let's go!

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:35.960
He doesn't seem to notice that 
he's winding his own noose.

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:38.630
Because of this,
Professor Same-chan will probably be

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.850
too scared to come around 
to the club for some time.

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.020
Huh?

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:49.850
What are you doing over 
there, Professor Usami?

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.370
I-it seems like someone decided 
to scare me a little...

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:55.480
J-Just because I'm sitting 
here, doesn't mean

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:57.400
that I'm so scared
 I can't stand up.

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.230
Right...

00:11:58.720 --> 00:12:02.000
Oh! I left the easel in there.

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.160
W-what should I do?

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:05.240
Professor, please calm down.

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:09.030
I don't really understand,

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:11.380
but how about we...

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:14.380
run in there and grab it for you?

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.220
Yes, if you would.

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:31.060
Geijutsuka Art Design Class

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.200
Geijutsuka Art Design Class

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:34.740
This is creepy.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:40.200
We were going to get the 
easel for Professor Usami,

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:40.200
If you would...

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:43.750
who was too frightened to stand.

00:12:45.300 --> 00:12:47.830
I wonder what could've been so scary.

00:12:48.040 --> 00:12:49.000
Right?

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:53.160
We hang out in the Art 
Room every da...y?

00:12:56.860 --> 00:12:58.820
What, what?
 Lemme see.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:04.810
 Art Room 2

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:02.090
This is the right room, right?

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:06.600
 Checks the name plate

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.460
Appears that way.

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:06.600
<b>Checks whether it's 
a person or a thing</b>

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:06.600
Hmm, nothing there...

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.600
<b>Looks for the entrance fee box</b>

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.600
How much? How much for one?

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.600
<b>Checks for a hidden camera</b>

00:13:07.070 --> 00:13:09.470
Gararara, excuse us!

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:11.310
I was sure Tono would be next,

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:11.310
Is anyone here?

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.870
so I was getting pumped up but...

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:15.340
Looks like some students 
we don't know came in.

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:16.310
What should we do?

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.710
What you ask?

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:18.960
We can't exactly do anything to

00:13:18.960 --> 00:13:20.650
people who aren't part of the club.

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:24.590
I don't think there's 
anything wrong with it.

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:26.270
Me neither!

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:28.310
Besides, if they're in GA 
then I'm their upperclassman.

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:30.620
Take this seriously, you art nerds!

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.670
They might seem like a

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.270
bunch of sitting ducks to you but...

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:37.220
Those kids are definitely 
fine, so do it already.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:39.470
The club's conscience and 
stopper, Mizubushi-senpai,

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:41.350
is without even an atom of hesitation?!

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:43.630
Do art students have no boundaries?!

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:48.420
But getting random students involved

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:49.830
I guess I'll start with 
the same tactic as before...

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:50.700
must be a breach of club policies.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:52.640
One wrong move and this club might

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:53.880
suffer the consequences.

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:55.560
Leave that to me!

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.050
Reflecting upon what happened 
with Professor Same-chan

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:00.000
I've prepared a certain something.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:01.030
A certain something?

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.140
Hey, hey, look at this.

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:05.360
What's that piece of paper?

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.630
<b> Consent Form
Only if you agree to the terms 
inscribed below sign your name and proceed.
1. Regardless of what happens, you take 
full responsibility for yourself.
2. You may not speak to the student 
council about anything that happens in this room.
3. The club assumes no responsibility 
for any injury incurred.</b>

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:13.680
I sent them in to help me,

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:14.960
but I'm supposed to be the teacher.

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:16.680
What am I doing?!

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:18.970
What are you doing, Professor Usami?

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.870
Why're you kneeling in 
the middle of the hall?

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:23.540
Oh, Professor Sasamoto, about that...

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:26.720
My leg! There was something on my leg!

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:28.670
What happened, Kisaragi?

00:14:28.670 --> 00:14:31.420
Something! Something cold 
touched the back of my neck!

00:14:31.610 --> 00:14:34.340
Ohh, I guess those things are breeding.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:35.980
We should probably exterminate them.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.190
Are you serious?!

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:38.200
 Eeek!

00:14:41.660 --> 00:14:43.440
Kisaragi, it's only this thing.

00:14:43.440 --> 00:14:44.800
Look up, here.

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:49.080
See? It's only a hanging wet sponge.

00:14:49.080 --> 00:14:52.040
Once you figure out what it 
is, there's nothing to it.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.050
You're right.

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:54.900
As long as we're careful 
to check above...

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:58.100
I thought the floor just sank below me.

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:01.560
So they distract us from above and

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.880
then place sponges on the floor.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:06.700
Of course!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:13.140
<b>Muwahaha</b>

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:07.790
Oh no!

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:10.690
Noda's taken the opportunity 
to absorb these evil tricks!

00:15:10.690 --> 00:15:13.160
Just like a dry sponge.

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:15.120
Hey, that set up...

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:15.120
Give me your hand.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.940
Did that junior do it?

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.940
Thanks.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.000
Homura was the one who set it up,

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.720
All right, let's keep moving!

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.610
but our visitor thought of it.

00:15:19.720 --> 00:15:20.790
Right!

00:15:23.130 --> 00:15:25.810
Despite his looks, he 
makes some bold moves.

00:15:25.810 --> 00:15:28.440
Well he made it into GA, didn't he?

00:15:28.870 --> 00:15:30.180
There're a lot who enjoy

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:32.120
pulling off pranks like these,
 at least among the boys.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:34.280
If you pull the rope here 
you can extend the arm.

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:36.950
This is really well designed.

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.170
Gosh, no.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:40.710
I just come up with these 
things occasionally.

00:15:41.130 --> 00:15:43.710
I'm so weak, I can't 
move it normally.

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:48.150
I'm going to need your help 
at the crucial moment.

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:50.200
Can I count on you?

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:52.460
Leave it to me!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:56.010
Crucial moment?

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.550
I bet he's just making 
sure he isn't responsible

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:59.000
for the consequences.

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:08.180
Did the eyes in that 
painting flash just now?

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:09.950
Hands are coming out of the wall!

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:14.700
<b>Bam! Bam bam bam!</b>

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:18.300
There's a hidden device?

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:21.830
Shit, sneaking around in the 
dark and hiding themselves...

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:25.720
If I find you, I'm going 
to drag you out of there!

00:16:32.980 --> 00:16:33.970
Be careful!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:37.420
Watch out!

00:16:37.420 --> 00:16:43.750
Vampires are child-molesting, 
pervert monsters!

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.460
They're perverts
! Perverts!

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:47.370
Do you understand? Do you?

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:50.910
Looks like you've gotten used
to the President's ways, Uozumi-kun.

00:16:47.370 --> 00:16:50.450
If you understand, respond!

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.280
If you hadn't dropped your head,

00:16:50.910 --> 00:16:52.330
Respond!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.290
you wouldn't have one right now.

00:16:56.940 --> 00:17:00.780
Whoa. This must have been 
a lot of work to set up.

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:05.270
Kisaragi, hurry up.

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:07.210
I can't. I can't make it through.

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:11.040
There are too many scary 
things along the way.

00:17:11.450 --> 00:17:15.140
It'll be fine! They're all just props.

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:14.250
Wow, that girl's about to cry.

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:17.400
Those Historical Art Club 
pieces are pretty effective.

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:16.680
They won't move.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.370
Just because you say that...

00:17:17.400 --> 00:17:19.130
But I wonder what it is.

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:26.910
<b>thump thump thump</b>

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:21.640
Making someone cry because of something

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:22.130
Ohh, hurry up already!

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:23.720
you made is really thrilling!

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:23.690
What's going on?

00:17:23.720 --> 00:17:26.920
People call that sadism, Aa-san.

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:29.500
Don't worry, Kisaragi.

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:32.730
I'll make these things unscary.

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:37.590
<b>Crash bang</b>

00:17:43.800 --> 00:17:46.320
Amazing! In Tomokane's wake...

00:17:46.740 --> 00:17:49.640
The monsters have all 
turned to abstract art.

00:17:49.980 --> 00:17:53.210
Our masterpieces of evil and torture!

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.840
What's the deal with that first year?

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:57.080
Don't worry.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:01.170
I planned for this.

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:03.500
I thought something like this might happen,

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:05.380
so I mixed in a surprise.

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:06.260
A surprise?

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.360
Yah!

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.430
Who put these inside?!

00:18:17.430 --> 00:18:18.240
See?

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:24.070
 Exit              Do Not Enter

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:22.340
Where is it already?! Where are we?!

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:23.550
Look! I found the exit!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.440
A door labeled "Exit" and a 
door labeled "Do Not Open."

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:29.100
A trap?

00:18:29.100 --> 00:18:30.550
Or maybe...

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:33.730
I choose <i>this </i>door!

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:32.710
 Do Not Open

00:18:33.740 --> 00:18:35.180
<b>A few minutes earlier</b>

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:38.840
Can we shove the 
leftover props in here?

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.310
Make sure you write something

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:42.200
so no one opens it by accident.

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:43.290
Okay!

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.940
I wonder why no one

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:47.060
ever takes their art work home.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:49.800
I have a feeling like something 
really dangerous is about to happen.

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:55.640
Kisaragi-chan's eyes are 
spinning like cartoon swirls!

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.580
Finish whatever you're doing Tomokane

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:58.930
and let's get out of here!

00:18:58.930 --> 00:19:02.320
Wait! I feel like if we leave 
we'll be admitting defeat!

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:04.840
Um...

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:11.060
Professor Usami was talking 
about a broken... what again?

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:13.930
No idea. Just grab 
something and let's go.

00:19:13.930 --> 00:19:15.330
Which one, which one?

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.840
Masa, find a way to 
stop Tomokane somehow.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.290
Anything as long as she stops, right?

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:23.160
 Skreeeeeee

00:19:27.650 --> 00:19:29.310
Sorry we're late!

00:19:29.310 --> 00:19:31.350
Oh, I'm so glad you're back-

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:35.470
I think one of these things 
should be what you asked for...

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:56.360
<b> Exit</b>

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:50.680
It's like the aftermath of a typhoon.

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:54.440
Like a soldier waking up from a dream.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:56.370
I thought of a haiku.

00:19:56.500 --> 00:20:00.110
Once a Haunted House
After a first year passes
Now a House of Corpses

00:20:00.110 --> 00:20:03.950
See? The first year can be both 
one year and a freshman...

00:20:01.770 --> 00:20:03.950
Finish cleaning up first.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:06.350
We just cleaned up this place, too.

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:09.370
 Letter of Membership

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:09.390
Here, President.

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:14.810
I never expected I would 
have so much fun at school.

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:18.550
This is the first time I've ever 
seen anyone submit one of these.

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:18.550
I'm looking forward to becoming a part of this club.

00:20:18.550 --> 00:20:21.090
I don't know whether I'll be 
able to come every week, but...

00:20:21.090 --> 00:20:22.530
Don't worry about it.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:23.410
As long as you're on the roster,

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.370
who cares if you're 
always sick or a ghost.

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:26.440
Hey.

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:30.420
This may be a late introduction, but...

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:33.780
I'm a GA Junior. 
My name is Tomokane.

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:36.660
Among the Freshman group 
that was just here,

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:38.250
the one who was exceptionally lively

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:40.460
is my younger sister.

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:46.660
What? Tomokane's brother was in there?

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:49.330
Oh, no. It's not like 
I actually saw him, but...

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:53.350
those deceptive tactics 
were definitely my brother's.

00:20:53.760 --> 00:20:55.520
My genetics say so.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:58.380
Which explains why you were so uppity.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.530
What's your brother like?

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:03.860
He's the only opponent that I 
can never lay a hand on.

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.740
Really? Not even you?

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.530
Whenever we played strategic games,

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:08.430
I win again!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.140
my brother was always better.

00:21:09.140 --> 00:21:10.580
I never won once.

00:21:10.580 --> 00:21:12.840
He wouldn't go easy on me at all.

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:16.180
Since he has a weak body,

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:19.130
my parents prohibited any 
physical retaliation.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:21.500
So, all the stress that 
I built up being around him,

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:23.460
I released when I played outside.

00:21:24.670 --> 00:21:26.290
So, could that be why...

00:21:26.290 --> 00:21:31.130
The reason behind your current 
nature is your brother?

00:21:31.500 --> 00:21:32.560
Damn it.

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:36.010
Staff Room

00:21:36.910 --> 00:21:39.510
You went to visit and already joined?

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:42.160
Yes, it seemed like a lot of fun, so...

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:44.710
Well, I'm glad it worked out.

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:46.300
Thank you.

00:21:46.740 --> 00:21:49.490
I feel like... I might get better.

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:51.520
So everything worked out as you hoped.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:52.710
Yes!

00:23:25.070 --> 00:23:40.060
Next episode

00:23:26.970 --> 00:23:29.680
I thought there were people 
here, but they're paintings!

00:23:29.680 --> 00:23:32.080
That's Trompe l'oeil, also 
known as deception art.

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:34.570
It's an art museum, Kisaragi-chan!

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:36.320
Then we've got no choice but to go!

00:23:36.080 --> 00:23:40.060
Trompe l'oeil

00:23:36.320 --> 00:23:39.400
These two are way too excited, as usual.
